# Keep LF line endings in the repository's own text files on every OS. The bug zoo projects and
# test fixtures are compared byte for byte, so a CRLF checkout (Git for Windows' default) would
# change what the tests see. QEDCode itself handles CRLF projects; see tests/unit/test_apply.py.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.docx binary
*.png binary
*.gguf binary
